NC QSO PARTY - for North Carolina entrants: the 100 NC counties, 49 US states (not NC) plus DC, the 13 Canadian provinces and territories, and one DX multiplier
The sponsor's 2026 rules: "NC participants: Work 100 North Carolina Counties, 49 US States (not NC) plus DC, 13 Canadian Provinces/Territories (AB, BC, MB, NB, NL, NS, NT, NU, ON, PE, QC, SK, and YT), plus one DX."
The states are listed here rather than included from S50.DOM, so North Carolina can be left out; the shared file is never edited for one contest.
Until #88 round 3 (2026-10-26) this file said INCLUDE without FILE, which the loader skipped, so no US state could be logged by an NC entrant (D7 too).
The counties come first, so a county code wins over a state or province alias spelled the same.

INCLUDE FILE NC_CTY.DOM
Al = AL,^Alabama
Ar = AR,^Arkansas
Az = AZ, ARI,^Arizona
Ca = CA,^California
Co = CO,^Colorado
Ct = CT, CON,^Connecticut
De = DE,^Delaware
